118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Journey represents our learning process, which began with learning how to use the software and continued through learning how to design the race car. Ambition is about how we want to reach the very top and compete with all our might. Last but not least, Focus is the discipline of always listening to one another and making sure every member works toward the same goal. Together, these words became our initials and guide every decision we make as a team.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
