251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Digital visualization allowed us to examine our car from different perspectives and identify possible improvements during the design process. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Branding also plays an important role in giving our team a recognizable identity and communicating our personality, objectives, and competitive spirit. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (We developed visual materials that connected the technical and creative sides of our project, including our presentations, promotional graphics, posters, and social media content. We used Canva to create and organize these materials, ensuring that our information was presented clearly and professionally. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (We also used Instagram to showcase our progress and share content about our team, while CapCut helped us edit videos to make our digital content more engaging. Each of these tools served a different purpose, but together they helped us communicate our work and present JAF Racing Team to a wider audience.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Another important part of our graphic design process was developing digital concepts for the physical car. Our car design was created in Fusion 360, while Creality Print allowed us to prepare selected components, such as the spoiler and front wing, for 3D printing. This allowed us to develop our designs digitally and prepare the components according to our project requirements. Throughout the process, we reviewed our designs and made adjustments when necessary, ensuring that our ideas continued to develop as we evaluated different possibilities. Overall, graphic design was not only about creating attractive visuals; it was also a way to communicate technical information, support decision-making, and connect our engineering work with the public presentation of our project. By combining 3D modelling, simulation, digital graphics, and visual communication, we were able to develop a more complete and professional representation of JAF Racing Team.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Graphic design is a way of expressing ideas and communicating information through visual elements. Throughout our project, we used graphic design to represent our thought processes, document the development of our ideas, and communicate the different stages of JAF Racing Team. It also helped us simplify complex concepts through visualization, making our designs easier to understand and evaluate. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
